      <cyrillic>албадах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>ALBADA-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. To force, compel, coerce; to exert administrative pressure; to administer; to subordinate, subdue, subjugate.</definition>
      <page>28</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠯᠪᠠᠳᠠᠨ ᠺᠢᠯᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
